  "details": "13695 `Display the tooltip panel under the Quick Menu and Main Menu`\n\nThis string is for the tooltip of the \"Show tooltips\" setting in User Interface > General UI Settings. This switching option also affects the tooltip of pickups and interactable objects placed on worlds. Please revise to mention those (world objects) in this tooltip.\n\nOr splitting it into two settings for menus and objects might be better.\n\nThis issue is already noted in Crowdin's comment (about a year before!). So, when you fix it, please mark it as resolved, too.",
